### RSU release, California
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/equity/calculate-tax-withholding
Content-Type: application/json

{"participant_id":"P-0001","award_type":"RSU","shares":1200,"market_price":55.25,"state_code":"CA"}

### Vesting schedule with as-of position
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/equity/vesting-schedule
Content-Type: application/json

{"grant_id":"G-RSU-1001","total_units":4800,"vesting_start_date":"2025-01-15","vesting_months":48,"cliff_months":12,"frequency_months":3,"as_of":"2026-10-08"}

### Reconcile cap table vs payroll
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/equity/reconcile-ledger
Content-Type: application/json

{"period_start":"2026-01-01","period_end":"2026-12-31",
 "cap_table_records":[{"grant_id":"G-RSU-1001","event_date":"2026-01-15","shares_impacted":1200,"gross_amount":66300.00,"tax_withheld_amount":26440.44}],
 "payroll_records":[{"grant_id":"G-RSU-1001","event_date":"2026-01-15","shares_impacted":1200,"gross_amount":66300.00,"tax_withheld_amount":26440.40}]}

### Ask the agent (needs ANTHROPIC_API_KEY)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/agent/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{"messages":[{"role":"user","content":"P-0001 had 1,200 RSUs release at $55.25 in California. No other supplemental wages this year. What gets withheld and how many shares to cover?"}]}

### Validate a Rule 10b5-1 plan at adoption (director/officer)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/equity/trading-plan/validate-adoption
Content-Type: application/json

{"plan_id":"PL-0001","participant_id":"P-0001","insider_role":"DIRECTOR_OR_OFFICER",
 "adoption_date":"2026-03-02","aware_of_mnpi":false,"includes_required_certification":true,
 "next_earnings_disclosure_date":"2026-05-01","first_trade_date":"2026-06-01",
 "plan_expiration_date":"2027-03-02"}

### Pre-clear a specific trade against an adopted plan
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/equity/trading-plan/check-trade
Content-Type: application/json

{"plan_id":"PL-0001","insider_role":"DIRECTOR_OR_OFFICER","adoption_date":"2026-03-02",
 "next_earnings_disclosure_date":"2026-05-01","plan_expiration_date":"2027-03-02",
 "trade_date":"2026-06-15","side":"SELL","shares":1000,"price":52,
 "scheduled_trades":[{"trade_date":"2026-06-15","side":"SELL","shares":1000,"limit_price":50}]}
